{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 886 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "cbbd64a144281242364b162b6d709fd710ac7f4145aa6e947c8d51792dd151c8" :edb/db-before-t 885 :edb/db-after-t 886 :edb/tx-data [[13194139534198 50 #inst "2026-10-06T10:02:40.677Z" 13194139534198 true] [17592186087697 1020 #edb/ref 17592186281855 13194139534198 true] [17592186087697 1020 #edb/ref 17592186281865 13194139534198 true] [17592186087753 1020 #edb/ref 17592186281829 13194139534198 true] [17592186087753 1020 #edb/ref 17592186281836 13194139534198 true] [17592186087753 1020 #edb/ref 17592186281846 13194139534198 true] [17592186281829 1017 #edb/ref 17592186281830 13194139534198 true] [17592186281829 1089 "q-104458" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281829 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534198 true] [17592186281829 1100 "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=-3,$ ${x}_{2}=-2,$ and ${x}_{3}=3,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $4.$ Find $P(x).$" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281829 1113 #uuid "fcd56ce7-673a-5e4c-a842-541a666d3fe8" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281829 1145 "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=-3,$ ${x}_{1}=-2,$ and ${x}_{3}=3,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=4,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =4(x-(-3))(x-(-2))(x-3) \\\\  & =4(x+3)(x+2)(x-3)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(x+3)(x+2)(x-3) & =4({x}^{2}+5x+6)(x-3) \\\\  & =4({x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+5{x}^{2}-15x+6x-18) \\\\  & =4({x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-9x-18) \\\\  & =4{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}-36x-72.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=4{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}-36x-72.$" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281830 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281831 13194139534198 true] [17592186281830 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281832 13194139534198 true] [17592186281830 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281833 13194139534198 true] [17592186281830 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281834 13194139534198 true] [17592186281830 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281835 13194139