,-$\n{{field-3}}$x\\,+$\n{{field-4}}" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281836 1113 #uuid "590f3038-6cc4-5c97-85c0-ebec225d6230" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281836 1145 "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=1,$ ${x}_{2}=-3,$ and ${x}_{3}=4,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=5,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =5(x-1)(x-(-3))(x-4) \\\\  & =5(x-1)(x+3)(x-4)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5(x-1)(x+3)(x-4) & =5({x}^{2}+2x-3)(x-4) \\\\  & =5({x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+2{x}^{2}-8x-3x+12) \\\\  & =5({x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-11x+12) \\\\  & =5{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}-55x+60.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=5{x}^{3}-10{x}^{2}-55x+60.$" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281837 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281838 13194139534198 true] [17592186281837 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281839 13194139534198 true] [17592186281837 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534198 true] [17592186281837 1041 "field-1" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281837 1104 #edb/ref 17592186281839 13194139534198 true] [17592186281837 1110 #uuid "3a2afe4d-ae4d-56b7-9a8e-785946d6dc98" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281838 1034 "4" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281838 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534198 true] [17592186281838 1111 #uuid "8b7b79a8-bd7d-5421-861f-a35d03d95d6a" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281839 1034 "5" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281839 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534198 true] [17592186281839 1111 #uuid "38e9bc78-4057-531d-8c84-04ac59c4b9ba" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281840 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281841 13194139534198 true] [17592186281840 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534198 true] [17592186281840 1041 "field-2" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281840 1104 #edb/ref 17592186281841 13194139534198 true] [17592186281840 1110 #uuid "a1210025-284b-5067-af6f-34c4151e1aad" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281841 1034 "10" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281841 1103 #edb/ref 175921860454