}_{2}=-4,$ and ${x}_{3}=1,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=2,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =2(x-(-4))(x-(-4))(x-1) \\\\  & =2(x+4)(x+4)(x-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2(x+4)(x+4)(x-1) & =2({x}^{2}+8x+16)(x-1) \\\\  & =2({x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+8{x}^{2}-8x+16x-16) \\\\  & =2({x}^{3}+7{x}^{2}+8x-16) \\\\  & =2{x}^{3}+14{x}^{2}+16x-32.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=2{x}^{3}+14{x}^{2}+16x-32.$" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281847 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281848 13194139534198 true] [17592186281847 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534198 true] [17592186281847 1041 "field-1" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281847 1104 #edb/ref 17592186281848 13194139534198 true] [17592186281847 1110 #uuid "91791d0a-1066-5c42-b09c-9cb09d183694" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281848 1034 "2" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281848 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534198 true] [17592186281848 1111 #uuid "e4c645a7-6e88-5972-b95f-905dac795ff5" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281849 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281850 13194139534198 true] [17592186281849 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534198 true] [17592186281849 1041 "field-2" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281849 1104 #edb/ref 17592186281850 13194139534198 true] [17592186281849 1110 #uuid "6bac3080-51d6-5bbf-b341-0d56be3ea619" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281850 1034 "14" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281850 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534198 true] [17592186281850 1111 #uuid "10c26c3e-2747-5197-ad23-a2ed18872e4d" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281851 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281852 13194139534198 true] [17592186281851 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534198 true] [17592186281851 1041 "field-3" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281851 1104 #edb/ref 17592186281852 13194139534198 true] [17592186281851 1110 #uuid "20b89ba4-b596-516d-8f05-c3c0e495998e" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281852 1034 "16" 131941395