{x}^{2}+x(4\\text{i})-x(4\\text{i})-(4\\text{i})^{2}) & = \\\\ -7(x-1)({x}^{2}+16) & = \\\\ -7({x}^{3}+16x-{x}^{2}-16) & = \\\\ -7{x}^{3}+7{x}^{2}-112x+112.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=-7{x}^{3}+7{x}^{2}-112x+112.$" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281866 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281867 13194139534198 true] [17592186281866 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534198 true] [17592186281866 1041 "field-1" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281866 1104 #edb/ref 17592186281867 13194139534198 true] [17592186281866 1110 #uuid "b12deaa4-cb34-525a-8ae8-02dd21b65c52" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281867 1034 "-7" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281867 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534198 true] [17592186281867 1111 #uuid "201c6278-7349-5fcd-8d3d-50191307ca04" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281868 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281869 13194139534198 true] [17592186281868 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534198 true] [17592186281868 1041 "field-2" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281868 1104 #edb/ref 17592186281869 13194139534198 true] [17592186281868 1110 #uuid "068d1b3d-9cd6-5ce6-9816-9ec16c2cfbdd" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281869 1034 "7" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281869 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534198 true] [17592186281869 1111 #uuid "d2840503-ce0b-5918-8349-edf8ae2b4dba" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281870 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281871 13194139534198 true] [17592186281870 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534198 true] [17592186281870 1041 "field-3" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281870 1104 #edb/ref 17592186281871 13194139534198 true] [17592186281870 1110 #uuid "0cd42360-fc09-5525-b898-248e077c1284" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281871 1034 "112" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281871 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534198 true] [17592186281871 1111 #uuid "9c01ee05-a997-5ef6-9dca-0abe4ae30cea" 13194139534198 true] [17592186281872 1000 #edb/ref 17592186281873 13194139534198 true] [17592186281872 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534198 true] [175921862